---
import CategoryArchive from '../../components/CategoryArchive.astro';

const articleGroups = [
  {
    label: 'Heating and Flow',
    subcategories: ['heating', 'air-lock', 'filters', 'jets'],
  },
  {
    label: 'Control Panel and Power',
    subcategories: ['controls'],
  },
  {
    label: 'Leaks and Water Loss',
    subcategories: ['leaks'],
  },
  {
    label: 'Pumps and Noise',
    subcategories: ['pumps'],
  },
];
---

<CategoryArchive category="troubleshooting" articleGroups={articleGroups}>
  <p>
    Use these guides to narrow down what is going wrong before you buy parts or call a
    technician. Start with the safest checks first (power, settings, and water temperature), then move to filters, pumps, leaks, and heating components.
  </p>
</CategoryArchive>
